Don't tell me you're gonna give up now.

167
00:14:15,877 --> 00:14:16,597
Not you.

168
00:14:16,897 --> 00:14:18,757
That's not the big brother I know.

169
00:14:19,517 --> 00:14:21,897
You remember your promise, don't you?

170
00:14:22,317 --> 00:14:23,257
Say something.

171
00:14:31,017 --> 00:14:39,777
Maybe I should have never been born.

172
00:14:40,577 --> 00:14:43,197
Maybe I never deserved to live in the first place.

173
00:14:45,037 --> 00:14:45,597
Huh?

174
00:14:45,957 --> 00:14:47,397
If Gold Roger had a son?

175
00:14:47,657 --> 00:14:48,897
