Come on.

183
00:15:10,217 --> 00:15:13,237
I bet all the pirates would worship that kid like a god.

184
00:15:13,877 --> 00:15:15,837
We'd have to do something really nasty.

185
00:15:16,337 --> 00:15:18,657
Like burn him alive and make everybody watch.

186
00:15:20,417 --> 00:15:21,517
There you go.

187
00:15:21,837 --> 00:15:22,957
Come on, pirates.

188
00:15:23,357 --> 00:15:25,217
Why don't you go join him?

189
00:15:27,637 --> 00:15:30,677
Then he'd probably cry and shut him down for good.

190
00:15:31,577 --> 00:15:34,157
I'm trash just like my dad.

191
