208
00:16:28,617 --> 00:16:31,117
A certain little brother I had to look after.

209
00:16:31,917 --> 00:16:34,117
Didn't want you turning out like me, you know.

210
00:16:34,117 --> 00:16:37,677
Oh, yeah.

211
00:16:38,157 --> 00:16:42,297
If you see Dadon, tell her I said hello.

212
00:16:43,077 --> 00:16:45,377
And thank her for putting up with us, too.

213
