That's fine.

220
00:17:12,477 --> 00:17:15,077
I have faith you can do it.

221
00:17:16,557 --> 00:17:18,137
Because you're my brother.

222
00:17:24,537 --> 00:17:26,717
Do you remember that day?

223
00:17:27,257 --> 00:17:34,197
Luffy, listen.

224
00:17:35,097 --> 00:17:36,877
There's only one way to live life.

225
00:17:37,617 --> 00:17:39,077
And that's without any regrets.

226
00:17:40,137 --> 00:17:40,537
Yeah.

227
00:17:41,517 --> 00:17:43,837
Someday, we're going to head out to sea.

228
00:17:44,517 --> 00:17:46,177
And live the way we want to live.

229
00:17:47,037 --> 00:17:49,877
More free than anyone else.

230
00:17:55,337 --> 00:17:56,437
