But it's alright.

239
00:18:16,897 --> 00:18:20,957
I realized I didn't need fame or fortune after all.

240
00:18:20,957 --> 00:18:25,897
All I needed was the answer to a single question.

241
00:18:25,897 --> 00:18:30,437
At the very end, did I deserve to be born?

242
00:18:30,437 --> 00:18:38,097
I will call you my son, who we've got plenty to talk about.

243
00:18:38,597 --> 00:18:40,817
Like you not killing my son.

244
00:18:41,777 --> 00:18:43,157
Ace, you're my brother!

245
00:18:43,357 --> 00:18:44,437
Damn it!

246
00:18:44,537 --> 00:18:46,897
Say whatever mean stuff you want!

247
00:18:46,897 --> 00:18:49,017
I'm still going to save you!

248
00:18:49,017 --> 00:18:49,277
I'm still going to save you!

249
00:18:49,277 --> 00:18:50,017
I'm still going to save you!

250
00:18:50,017 --> 00:18:51,017
I'm still going to save you!

251
00:18:51,017 --> 00:18:52,017
Listen up, pirates!

252
00:18:52,017 --> 00:18:54,137
Bring Ace to safety!

253
00:18:54,137 --> 00:18:58,017
And once you're done with that, destroy the Navy!

254
00:19:00,017 --> 00:19:02,197
Shut off!

255
00:19:02,577 --> 00:19:06,617
