I can't raise my voice anymore.

262
00:19:46,537 --> 00:19:47,257
Too weak.

263
00:19:49,837 --> 00:19:57,037
Could you tell everyone else what I'm about to say when I'm done?

264
00:19:57,037 --> 00:20:20,797
Pops, my family, and you, Luffy, thank you for caring about someone like me, who's good

265
00:20:20,797 --> 00:20:27,997
for nothing, who this world never wanted, who has such bad blood in his veins.

266
00:20:39,197 --> 00:20:39,757
Thank you...

267
00:20:46,877 --> 00:20:48,157
for loving me...

268
00:20:50,797 --> 00:21:06,317
I...

269
00:21:20,797 --> 00:21:49,857
Old man, yeah, tell me the truth.

270
00:21:49,857 --> 00:21:56,857
Did I deserve to be born or was it just a mistake?

271
00:21:56,857 --> 00:21:59,857
That's not for me to say.

272
00:21:59,857 --> 00:22:02,857
You just keep living and hope you find out.

273
00:22:19,857 --> 00:22:26,857
Ace...

274
00:22:26,857 --> 00:22:34,857
Ace, no.

275
00:22:34,857 --> 00:22:51,857
Ace, no.

276
00:22:51,857 --> 00:23:06,857
